WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.343
Yes, yes!

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.470
Yes, welcome.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.160
Thank you very much, great show tonight.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.750
One of my favorites, JB Smoove,

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.080
gonna be on the program tonight.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.650
He is always hilarious,

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.980
and that sound of one man
clapping, Andy Richter.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:17.990
How are you, Andy?

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.620
Hi Conan, how are you?

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.660
I'm doing really well.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.310
It's nice to see you
from this safe distance.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.143
Yes, it is.

00:00:24.143 --> 00:00:28.620
It's good, it's as per your contract.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.890
Yeah.
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.550
Going back to 1993,

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.536
by the way.
That's correct.

00:00:32.536 --> 00:00:33.369
That's correct.

00:00:33.369 --> 00:00:36.520
This is the way I've wanted
it long, long before COVID.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:37.880
How are you, old chum?

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.820
I'm good. How are you?

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.810
It's been a while.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.940
It has been a while,

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.500
but I really love that
we're here in this theater.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.930
I love being in a theater,
it just gives me the sense

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.930
that we're getting
closer to show business.

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:49.763
Yes.

00:00:49.763 --> 00:00:52.120
You know, we're not really there yet,

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.180
but we're in a theater,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.013
[Andy] Right.

00:00:54.013 --> 00:00:55.350
and we're closer.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:58.360
It's like Public Access.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:02.830
Like it's not exactly
TV, but it is kind of TV.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.690
Okay, okay.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.500
I'm gonna be honest with
you, that bummed me out.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.780
Oh, I'm sorry.
That really bummed me out.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:09.613
I'm sorry.

00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:11.920
I mean, that's kind of what I do though.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.360
I know, it's true.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.063
Andy Richter, depressing
Conan since September of '93.

00:01:18.063 --> 00:01:19.950
(Conan laughing)

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:22.780
Hey, speaking of, we
gotta talk about this.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.950
Last night, I announced that I wanted

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.530
to fill my audience here
at the Largo Theater

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.260
with cardboard cutouts of fans,

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.100
just like Major League Baseball was doing.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.630
So to get an idea of
what that would be like,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:42.020
I had our prop department go into storage

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:46.000
at Warner Brothers, and find
every random cardboard cutout

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.970
they could find, and they
brought in the strangest

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.670
selection, but we put 'em in the audience.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:54.250
We've got Ruth Bader Ginsburg right there.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:57.540
We have Conrad Bain from,
"Diff'rent Strokes."

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:59.070
The dad on, "Diff'rent Strokes."

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:01.870
We have a life size, six foot six cutout

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.660
of former FBI director, James Comey.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.650
I think he's either
taking the oath of office

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:12.050
or very formally trying
to catch a baseball.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.380
I don't know what's happening there.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.050
And then we've got four,
count 'em four Kevin Harts.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.020
I think we bought those in bulk.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.280
Andy, what do you think of
our audience right there?

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.180
I think it's great.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.490
I love that, how they're
all to actual scale.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.200
Here's what I have decided to do.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.970
I want to fill the rest of the audience

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:34.620
with actual cardboard
cutouts of our real fans

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.020
who are watching at home.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.380
That's right, you can be
sitting in my audience.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.830
We'll make a cardboard cutout of you.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:45.830
All you have to do is go
to TeamCoco.com/cutouts,

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:49.780
upload a photo of yourself,
and you may be able

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:53.960
to join our audience in
cardboard cutout form.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.050
Isn't this a great idea, Andy?

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.370
It is a great idea.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.470
Yeah.
I mean, we gotta

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:58.810
be making some money off it, right?

00:02:58.810 --> 00:02:59.900
We're charging people,

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.060
like the baseball...
No, I didn't,

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.870
it's too late, I didn't think of that.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.680
I should have thought
of a way to make this

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.010
into a money making scheme.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.430
I didn't do that, this is free,

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.710
but if you send us your photos, listen,

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.150
people are already doing it.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:18.150
We announced this yesterday,
already 5,000 people.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.310
Wow.
Seriously, 5,000 people

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.410
have requested and sent in photos,

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.990
so keep sending those photos in.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:29.090
You can be part of our audience,
and here's the other thing,

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:33.040
I would love it, if your
picture was laughing,

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.800
doesn't have to, I get it.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.700
I've seen this show.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.080
If you're not thrilled, you can, you know,

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.980
be frowning or maybe just checking

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.520
out a little bit, you know?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.300
It's your decision on what kind

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.560
of photograph you want to have.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.200
We want it to be realistic.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.800
And I would say, Andy, you're
often scoping out the crowd.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:55.410
A good third of the crowd,
usually not thrilled?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.760
Yeah, well a lot of 'em
don't speak English.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.250
They're here on like,
sort of like tour group.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.120
I don't know how, it's like we get,

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.030
they're just, they're very easy to get.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.790
Yes.
We give 'em a bottle

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:09.759
of water and an orange, and they're set.

00:04:09.759 --> 00:04:10.770
(Conan laughing)

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.490
So, they laugh at the wrong spots.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.420
We are technically a sanctuary show.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.090
People come here for
sanctuary and immunity

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.330
from being deported.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:20.460
Yes.
It's us

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.550
and, "The Price is Right."

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:24.677
We're the two shows that people flock to.

00:04:24.677 --> 00:04:27.410
Yeah, you do not come on down on our show.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.200
All right, seriously, you can do this.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.890
Send us your photo and you
will be sitting in our audience

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.150
and you'll get to see
yourself, and that's all...

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:36.983
Yeah?
Can the photos be

00:04:36.983 --> 00:04:38.940
clothing optional?

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.900
I think, I want to avoid legal trouble.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.850
I'm gonna say the photos
should be clothing mandatory

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:50.120
for now, and then we
may, we'll see how long

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.520
this quarantine goes on.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.090
Maybe the clothes will
come off at some point.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.550
All right, yeah, 'cause we haven't

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.750
had nudes in the audience
since like early 90s.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.031
'95 was the last one.

00:04:59.031 --> 00:04:59.864
[Andy] Yeah, yeah.

00:04:59.864 --> 00:05:00.697
Yeah.

00:05:00.697 --> 00:05:01.960
It was a hygiene thing.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.830
It was a hygiene thing and yeah,

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.590
we had to steam clean the
seats, every, it was...

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.520
We, I did.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.990
Well, you did, I can't,
I'm the host of the show.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.990
[Andy] I know, I know.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:13.823
You remember,

00:05:13.823 --> 00:05:15.130
that was a big...
Big union thing.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.630
[Conan] Big part of your job early on.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:17.463
Yeah.

